  "note": "The served files are bake 10 (2026-11-15), carried unchanged from the prototype branch. The bake command is reconstructed from the transcript of the session that ran bake 10, with --room added (spec S4.12) and --pack in place of the separate gltfpack run that followed it, which used the same arguments. The prototype branch never recorded it. `verified` says what was run from a clean inputs folder to check it. Refresh `inputs` and `files` with record_build.mjs.",
